      "displayName": "Orison Relief: Small Fabrication Order",
      "titleSource": "localized_clean",
      "titleConfidence": "high",
      "briefing": "Now then,\n\nAfter the Nine Tails attack, the folks at Crusader could do with more than just a helping hand. What they need are proper propulsors to help replace the ones damaged in the attacks.\n\nWe've attached a blueprint outlining what materials you'll need to create them. Up to you whether you go out and find those materials yourself or buy them from a trader. Either way you will need access to an Item Fabricator to make the propulsors yourself.\n\nOnce you're done bring them to [Destination] and one of the team will sort out the rest.\n\nTa very much,\nHal Grimsby\nContracts Manager\n\nCORNERSTONE MAINTENANCE\n\"Building on the Foundations of our Past.\"",
